  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kaliningrad hamn f&#xf6;rstudi</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kaliningrad port, FS - Port reception facilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets syfte &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillg&#xe4;ngligheten och kvaliteten p&#xe5; existerande mottagningsanl&#xe4;ggningar f&#xf6;r olja och avfall i hamnarna i Kaliningrad. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att minska utsl&#xe4;ppen av fartygsavfall i &#xd6;ster- sj&#xf6;n och eliminera illegala utsl&#xe4;pp. L&#xe4;mplighetsstudie.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the reception facilities for ship generatewaste in the Ports of Kaliningrad, as a part of the HELCOM Recommendation on Reception Facilities and the Baltic strategy to decrease discharges and to eliminate illegal disposal from ships and thus to prevent pollution of the Baltic Sea. Feasibility study</narrative>
  </description>
